# These files are executed or parsed on Linux CI runners. A CRLF checkout there
# fails with "bash: $'\r': command not found" (or a YAML parse error), which
# looks like a code bug and is not one. Force LF regardless of the contributor's
# core.autocrlf. Scoped to the affected extensions on purpose: renormalising the
# vendored C sources would produce a huge, pointless diff.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.go   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
